# Anchored, and it has to stay anchored. The knowledge corpus is 132 .md
# files under app/data/knowledge/, and it is the whole point of the service.
# Docker's * does not cross a slash, so the unanchored form happened to spare
# them, but nobody should have to know that to read this file: written as
# **/*.md it would ship an image that starts cleanly, answers every question,
# and knows nothing.
/*.md
